# Time-limited Trivy exceptions for the organisation AppSec workflow, which runs `trivy fs` and
# `trivy image` from the repository root and reads this file by default. Every entry names one
# advisory, carries an expiry date and is recorded in dependency-admission.json. An expired entry
# stops applying, so the finding blocks the verdict again until it is fixed.

